# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.web. BuildKit uses this file instead of the root
# .dockerignore (which excludes web/ entirely). Only web/ goes in, minus everything the build
# regenerates — above all the host's node_modules, which are built for the host's OS — and any
# local env file, which may hold a real credential.
*
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/.next-*/
web/dist-pkg/
web/coverage/
web/public/monaco/
web/.env*
web/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
